["İzessemaunfetaret","Ve izelkevakibun teseret","Ve izelbiharu fucciret","Ve izelkuburu bu´siret","´Alimet nefsun ma kaddemet ve ahharet","Ya eyyuhel´insanu ma ğarreke birabbikelkeriymi","Elleziy halekake fesevvake fe´adeleke","Fiy eyyi suretin ma şae rekkebeke","Kella bel tukezzibune biddiyni","Ve inne ´aleykum lehafizıyne","Kiramen katibiyne","Ya´lemune ma tef´alune","İnnel´ebrare lefiy na´ıymin","Ve innelfuccare lefiy cahıymin","Yasleneha yevmeddiyni","Ve ma hum ´anha biğaibiyne","Ve ma edrake ma yevmuddiyni","Summe ma edrake ma yevmuddiyni","Yevme la temliku nefun linefsin şey´en vel´emru yevmeizin lillahi"]
